 The inputs and outputs have three entries, so the domain and codomain are both $\R^3$. The possible outputs all lie on the $xy$-plane, and every point on the $xy$-plane is an output of $T$ (with itself as the input), so the range of $T$ is the $xy$-plane.

 Be careful not to confuse the codomain with the range here. The range is a plane, but it is a plane in $\R^3$, so the codomain is still $\R^3$. The outputs of $T$ all have three entries; the last entry is simply always zero.

